        "source": "## 2. Model Architecture (Frozen Backbone)\n\nTo ensure **fair comparison**, we use the same architecture for all runs:\n\n```\nInput (784)\n \u2192 Linear(784 \u2192 256)\n \u2192 Activation\n \u2192 Linear(256 \u2192 128)\n \u2192 Activation\n \u2192 Linear(128 \u2192 10)\n```\n\nOnly the activation function varies based on the parameter."
