            "type": "text",
            "content": "Dataset Statistics:\n  Training samples: 54000\n  Validation samples: 6000\n  Test samples: 10000\n  Classes: 10 (Fashion-MNIST categories)\n  Input dimension: 784 (28x28 flattened)\n"
