        "type": "markdown",
        "source": "## 3. Optimizer and Scheduler Setup\n\nDifferent optimizers have different convergence characteristics:\n- **SGD**: Baseline, requires careful tuning\n- **SGD + Momentum**: Faster convergence, smoother updates\n- **Adam**: Adaptive learning rates, robust default\n- **AdamW**: Adam with weight decay decoupling\n- **RMSprop**: Good for RNNs, adaptive learning rates\n\nSchedulers can improve final performance or convergence speed."
