        "source": "## 1. Dataset Preparation\n\n**Fashion-MNIST** is used because:\n- Simple enough to train fast (28x28 grayscale images)\n- Hard enough to expose failures in configuration\n- Well-known baseline for MLPs\n\nWe normalize to [0,1] and flatten to 784-dimensional vectors."
